OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA good deal of dry weather
OL,6,Ftoday with some bright or sunny
OL,7,Fintervals, best in the east. There
OL,8,Fwill still be a few showers mainly
OL,9,Fover western areas, such as Moray and
OL,10,FWest Aberdeenshire. Less windy and a
OL,11,Flittle milder.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and
OL,14,Fnight with some clear periods. More
OL,15,Fcloud in the far west at times. Winds
OL,16,Fmainly light.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA mostly dry and bright day
OL,19,Fwith some sunny spells, and quite mild
OL,20,Fespecially along the north coast. More
OL,21,Fcloud possible in Upper Deeside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
