OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA bright
OL,6,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,7,Fpatchy rain. Saturday cloudy with
OL,8,Foccasional rain then Sunday dry with
OL,9,Fsome sunshine.
